    "takeaway": "One gateway, distinct owners: Scheme defines meaning; Go integrates cloud state; Rust mediates effects.",
    "runtime-title": "RUST / FINAL EXECUTION AUTHORITY",
    "matrix-legend": "Cells show declared relationships between owners. Bidirectional relations appear in both directions. Zero Trust requirements are shown separately because they constrain the whole gateway; assurance links describe design contracts, not request traffic.",
